    "longDescription": "ClashLite is a lightweight Mihomo-based client designed for users who manage their own proxy configurations.\n\nKey Features\n• Import and manage compatible configurations\n• Switch between active configurations\n• Start and stop connections easily\n• View routing rules and logs\n• Perform latency tests for nodes\n• Support subscription updates\n• Provide advanced configuration options\n\nImportant Notes\nClashLite does not provide any servers, nodes, or network services.\nYou are required to prepare your own Mihomo(ClashMeta)/Clash-compatible configuration to use this app.",
